{
 "brief": "Hamas reaffirmed its commitment to agreements reached with mediators and the \"Peace Council\" regarding implementation of the second phase of the Gaza ceasefire accord, the Shehab Wire reported. The movement emphasized the seriousness of its position in advancing the negotiation process and said it would continue engaging with \"positivity and responsibility\" to complete the agreement.\n\nThe statement came as discussions over the ceasefire's next stages remain ongoing. Hamas indicated it would adhere to the terms previously negotiated with international and regional mediators overseeing the talks on the Gaza conflict.",
